      "en": "Above him stood the seraphim. Each one had six wings. With two he covered his face. With two he covered his feet. With two he flew.",
      "ko": "스랍들은 모셔 섰는데 각기 여섯 날개가 있어 그 둘로는 그 얼굴을 가리었고 그 둘로는 그 발을 가리었고 그 둘로는 날며",
      "source_text_hash": "1dc38a8b34ae05e9ee56fe184305a8de30a49ef490112e5b2edd0d167b68867f",
      "translation_text_hash": "cfc3ad10907b584f5948910af4abfb468ac5616ca6def42aa476da78032ace14",
