      "en": "One called to another, and said, “Holy, holy, holy, is the LORD of Armies! The whole earth is full of his glory!”",
      "ko": "서로 창화하여 가로되 거룩하다 거룩하다 거룩하다 만군의 여호와여 그 영광이 온 땅에 충만하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "229f67ca17224b5a001bee14cf0772a3e9ddc7c6e7e5db2260dc8b5543fb4a46",
      "translation_text_hash": "f5a1995fd01b0efd091978a36a95c65c6035164d87d543536f486ca1e81bb8d1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
